# Retag

Atoms emit tags. Screens compose atoms. Add and export a kit brick before
inventing a raw tag outside the kit.

## Zones

- `src/kit/ui/**` — raw HTML / host markup OK.
- `index.html` — document frame only.
- `src/components/**`, `src/views/**` — **0** raw layout / typography / controls.
- App frame (`src/App.svelte`) — frame `Block`, skip link, header/main
  siblings, view. Never open a file on `Box`.

## Prefer

| Instead of | Use |
| --- | --- |
| `<div>` | `Box` / `Stack` / `Group` / `Grid` |
| `<p>` / `<span>` / `<h*>` | `Text` / `Inline` / `Title` |
| landmarks | `Block` with a required `tag` |
| lists | `List` / `ListItem` |
| form | `Form` + `FormItem` + `Label` |
| CTA | `Button` with `variant` / `size` |
| card surface | `Card` |
| unknown tag | `src/kit/utils/tags.ts` groups, then a brick |

`bun run lint:ui8px` and `bun run validate:ui8px-aria` must stay green. When
a UI structure script exists, it fails a screen that opens on `Box`, contains
more than one `Block`, or uses raw layout tags.

If no brick covers the tag, extend the kit. Do not fall back to raw HTML in
views. Do not dump utility-class chains on a primitive to fake another
primitive.
